  "_comment": "UC-BR-01 Debt Cost Ladder. Implementation.md 12.6: the character needs ₹2,000 for 3 months and ranks four sources by TOTAL REPAID, not by instalment — that is the whole lesson, and the misconception compare_emi_not_total is exactly the trap. The trap is load-bearing: buy-now-pay-later stretches to SIX months, so it has the smallest monthly payment of the four and the second-largest total. Ordering by instalment and ordering by total must stay different or the misconception cannot occur; games.test.ts asserts this. Totals are tuned to the plan's own example figures (₹2,000 vs ₹2,600 vs ₹3,100+). No real lender, app or brand is named anywhere.",
